  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Positioned within walking distance of Karaka Bay Beach in one of the area’s most tightly held coastal enclaves, this exceptional estate offers an outstanding lifestyle for active families. Set on a quiet slip road amongst a small collection of quality homes, the substantial residence combines versatile living, superb entertaining, and resort-style amenities in a truly special seaside setting.\r\n\r\nSpanning two expansive levels, the light-filled interiors embrace the home’s coastal position with timber floors, plantation shutters, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a series of north-facing entertaining spaces. Upstairs, living areas extend effortlessly to a sun-soaked balcony, attractive tiled terrace, integrated swimming pool, and a secluded loggia. At the heart of the home, the sleek contemporary kitchen features expansive stone benches, a walk-in pantry, and a chef-friendly gas range. A nearby double bedroom is serviced by a guest bathroom.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, the main suite enjoys a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, and private courtyard, while two further bedrooms share a family bathroom alongside a bespoke laundry. Adding further flexibility, separate apartment-style accommodation with its own outdoor flow includes a spacious living area, dine-in kitchen, double bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, plus direct connection to a secluded home office, ideal for extended family, guests, or work-from-home living.\r\n\r\nWarm, sun-filled, and well insulated, the home includes multiple heat pumps and excellent storage throughout. Internal-access double garaging is complemented by a separate single garage, while generous off-street parking provides easy access for a boat or jet skis.\r\n\r\nSet on a securely gated and fully fenced 835sqm (approx.) landscaped site with flat lawns for children and pets, this rare coastal retreat is within walking distance of Churchill Park School and zoned for Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
